  13:source\asw/main.c **** /**
  14:source\asw/main.c **** * \file    main.c
  15:source\asw/main.c **** * \author  V S Agilan (application), PSoC Creator template
  16:source\asw/main.c **** * \date    INC 11D: 2026-10
  17:source\asw/main.c **** *
  18:source\asw/main.c **** * \brief   Application entry point of the WAV / MP3 player: OS start, the tasks and
  19:source\asw/main.c **** *          the interrupt service routines
  20:source\asw/main.c **** *
  21:source\asw/main.c **** * \details
  22:source\asw/main.c **** * main() only starts the operating system (Erika OS, OSEK). Everything else runs
  23:source\asw/main.c **** * in the tasks and ISRs of this file, which call the modules of the player:
  24:source\asw/main.c **** *
  25:source\asw/main.c **** *   | Task / ISR      | Started by                          | Does                                 
  26:source\asw/main.c **** *   |-----------------|-------------------------------------|--------------------------------------
  27:source\asw/main.c **** *   | systick_handler | SysTick, every 1 ms                 | counts cnt_systick (alarm time base) 
  28:source\asw/main.c **** *   | tsk_init        | start-up, runs once                 | drivers, EE_system_init, MP3_Init    
  29:source\asw/main.c **** *   | tsk_control     | ev_1s, ev_Button1..ev_Button4       | MP3_ProcessEvent() (player state)    
  30:source\asw/main.c **** *   | tsk_reader      | ev_BufEmpty (set by SOUND_isr)      | MP3_Reader() (SD read + convert)     
ARM GAS  C:\Users\agila\AppData\Local\Temp\ccAj2Uax.s 			page 2


  31:source\asw/main.c **** *   | tsk_display     | alarm alrm_display, every 200 ms    | MP3__showSong() (TFT song list)      
  32:source\asw/main.c **** *   | tsk_background  | tsk_init                            | idle loop, lowest priority           
  33:source\asw/main.c **** *   | isr_Button      | button interrupt                    | SetEvent(tsk_control, ev_ButtonN)    
  34:source\asw/main.c **** *   | isr_Timer       | sample timer, 22050 Hz              | SOUND_isr() (next sample to the VDAC)
  35:source\asw/main.c **** *
  36:source\asw/main.c **** * Events and alarms are configured in the OSEK configuration (OIL file), not here.
  37:source\asw/main.c **** *
  38:source\asw/main.c **** * Operation by the four buttons (HMI also via UART log):
  39:source\asw/main.c **** *
  40:source\asw/main.c **** *   | Button  | Stopped       | Playing       | Pausing |
  41:source\asw/main.c **** *   |---------|---------------|---------------|---------|
  42:source\asw/main.c **** *   | Button1 | previous song | volume +      | -       |
  43:source\asw/main.c **** *   | Button2 | next song     | volume -      | -       |
  44:source\asw/main.c **** *   | Button3 | play          | pause         | resume  |
  45:source\asw/main.c **** *   | Button4 | -             | stop          | stop    |
  46:source\asw/main.c **** *
  47:source\asw/main.c **** * The table follows the code of MP3_ProcessEvent() (see also mp3.h). The comment that
  48:source\asw/main.c **** * was here before INC 11D said "Button 1: Increase Volume, Next Song" and "Button 2:
  49:source\asw/main.c **** * Decrease Volume, Prev Song"; the song direction was the other way round (N11).
  50:source\asw/main.c **** *
  51:source\asw/main.c **** * Start-up sequence of tsk_init (order matters, N1):
  52:source\asw/main.c **** *   UART_LOG_Start, SOUND_SAMPLE_Start, LED_Init, SEVEN_Init, TFT_init, SOUND_Init,
  53:source\asw/main.c **** *   EE_system_init, MP3_Init, SetRelAlarm (alrm_1s, alrm_display), ActivateTask
  54:source\asw/main.c **** *   (tsk_reader, tsk_control, tsk_background), TerminateTask.
  55:source\asw/main.c **** *
  56:source\asw/main.c **** * \todo <todos>
  57:source\asw/main.c **** * \warning tsk_control must not interrupt a running MP3_Reader() (shared reader state),
  58:source\asw/main.c **** *          check the task priorities in the OIL file (N6, and N7 in mp3.c).
  59:source\asw/main.c **** * \warning This file was changed in INC 11D by COMMENTS AND NOTES ONLY. No statement,
  60:source\asw/main.c **** *          declaration or value was changed. Things that could be improved in the code
  61:source\asw/main.c **** *          are listed in N2, N3, N8, N9 and N11 and are left for a code increment.
  62:source\asw/main.c **** * \warning This software is a PROTOTYPE version and is not designed or intended
  63:source\asw/main.c **** *          for use in production, especially not for safety-critical applications!
  64:source\asw/main.c **** *
  65:source\asw/main.c **** * Changelog:\n
  66:source\asw/main.c **** *  - 6.11.18 : template
  67:source\asw/main.c **** *  - INC 3   : debug task with the ISR tick count (now in the #if 0 block, N10)
  68:source\asw/main.c **** *  - INC 10  : TFT_init() before MP3_Init(), tsk_display, alarm alrm_display
  69:source\asw/main.c **** *  - INC 11D : Doxygen file header and function comments in the project style,
  70:source\asw/main.c **** *              notes N1..N11 at the end of the file, ASCII only. No code change.
  71:source\asw/main.c **** *
  72:source\asw/main.c **** * \copyright Copyright 2016
