  77:source\asw/main.c **** * Contact Prof.Dr.-Ing. Peter Fromm, peter.fromm@h-da.de, Birkenweg 8 64295 Darmstadt - GERMANY for
  78:source\asw/main.c **** *
  79:source\asw/main.c **** * \warning This software is a PROTOTYPE version and is not designed or intended for use in producti
  80:source\asw/main.c **** * The user represents and warrants that it will NOT use or redistribute the Software for such purpo
  81:source\asw/main.c **** * This prototype is for research purposes only. This software is provided "AS IS," without a warran
  82:source\asw/main.c **** **/
