 320:source\asw/main.c **** /**
 321:source\asw/main.c ****  * \brief Reader task: refill the sound buffer whenever the sound driver has freed one.
 322:source\asw/main.c ****  *
 323:source\asw/main.c ****  * SOUND_isr() sets ev_BufEmpty each time it has switched to the other buffer. The task
 324:source\asw/main.c ****  * wakes up, clears the event and calls MP3_Reader(), which reads the next block from
 325:source\asw/main.c ****  * the SD card, converts it and fills the freed buffer. The reader must finish within
 326:source\asw/main.c ****  * one buffer time (1024 samples = 46.4 ms at 22050 Hz), otherwise the sound driver
 327:source\asw/main.c ****  * counts an underrun.
 328:source\asw/main.c ****  *
 329:source\asw/main.c ****  * \note Never ends. The TerminateTask() at the end is not reached (N7).
