 402:source\asw/main.c **** /**
 403:source\asw/main.c ****  * \brief Sample timer interrupt, 22050 Hz: give the next sample to the sound driver.
 404:source\asw/main.c ****  *
 405:source\asw/main.c ****  * All work is done in SOUND_isr(): output of one sample, buffer swap and ev_BufEmpty
 406:source\asw/main.c ****  * for tsk_reader. The return value of SOUND_isr() (RC_ERROR_BUFFER_EMTPY on an underrun)
 407:source\asw/main.c ****  * is not evaluated here; the driver counts the underruns itself (N2).
 408:source\asw/main.c ****  *
